    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Intelligence Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=dKA6FqhkPRD5rLhA]], [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=dKA6FqhkPRD5rLhA]]</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]] possesses the target, consumes its brain, and teleports inside its skull.</p><p class=\"feature\">While there, the [[lookup @name lowercase]] has &amp;Reference[Total Cover] against attacks and other effects originating outside its host. The [[lookup @name lowercase]] retains its Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores; its understanding of Deep Speech; its telepathy; and its Detect Intelligence trait. It otherwise adopts the target’s game statistics. It knows everything the target knew, including spells and languages.</p><p class=\"feature\">If the host body dies, the [[lookup @name lowercase]] must leave it. The [[lookup @name lowercase]] is also forced out if the target regains its devoured brain by means of a <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.spells.Item.phbsplWish000000]{Wish}</em> spell.</p><p class=\"feature\">By spending 5 feet of its movement, the [[lookup @name lowercase]] can voluntarily leave the body, teleporting to the nearest unoccupied space within 5 feet of it. The body then dies unless its brain is restored before the end of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]’s next turn.</p>",
